**What to check in your own answer.** The error names `registration-helpers.ts:21`, because the assertion that failed is the first line of `expectFormFilled`. Below it, the error names `practice-checker.spec.ts:6`, which is the line of the test that called the helper. The `Received` line shows the email that `fillRegistrationForm` typed, so the page was right and the expected value was wrong.
